---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import InfiniteSlider from '../components/InfiniteSlider.astro';
import StockTicker from '../components/StockTicker.astro';
import Carousel from '../components/Carousel.astro';
import SeeMoreInfo from '../components/SeeMoreInfo.astro';
const { services = "/services"} = Astro.props;

import mainImage04 from '../assets/images/background/04star-bottle-1.webp';



const Name = "Stellarwaves-5";
let TopColum2 = "Can I send a message into infinity?"
let TopColum3 = "CAN MY MESSAGE BE ETERNAL?"
---
<Layout title={Name}>
    <SeeMoreInfo titleColum2 = {TopColum2}, titleColum3 = {TopColum3}>
        <p slot="column2">
            Of course you can send your message into infinity; you can also share your story beyond time, you can send your letters across galaxies, you can send your message into Eternity. You can make your words stay forever in space.
            <a class="blink-02" href={services}>To send your Message, just click here.</a>
            Send a message to an eternal love. A message for someone who is no longer by your side. Imagine that in a thousand years, someone finds your message floating among the stars. This site does not just send words: it sends memories, dreams, farewells, hopes. Your message will be part of a collection that represents who we are, what we feel, what we desire. Share your thoughts with the universe. Your message deserves a place in the deep sky. Your memories, your dreams, can travel beyond. Make them part of the sky. Leave your mark in the immensity. Leave your mark for eternity. How can I make my words stay in eternity? This is very simple. To send your Message, you need to click here.
            <a class="blink-02" href={services}>To send your Message, just click here.</a>    
        </p>

        <p slot="column3">
            Yes, of course, your message can be eternal. Write what you feel, let the cosmos keep it. Once it is sent into space, it will remain in the middle of a universe where the stars keep ancient secrets; you too can leave your mark that transcends time. Remember that every word sent to the sky becomes light, traveling through cosmic space as a testament to what we feel. A sigh that never found a voice. A promise that deserved to fly beyond Earth. A memory that asks to be kept among the stars. Write what you feel. Send it. Make your truth cross constellations. Make what you want to transmit become an echo that never fades. It is not just a message: it is your mark in infinity, your offering to the cosmos, your declaration that transcends generations, languages, and worlds. Every word sent is a spark of eternity, a reminder that, even in the silence of space, everything you express will remain as a signal in infinite space. Remember that in the grand stage of the universe, where the stars witness eternities, your voice can become a legend.
        </p>
    </SeeMoreInfo>
</Layout>
<style>
    body{
        /* background-image: url(../assets/images/background/star-bottle-4-blu.webp); 
        
       planet_9_art_1_1400 
        
        */
        background: center / 100% 100% no-repeat url(../assets/images/background/new/planet_9_art_1_1400.webp);
    }
</style>


